H0300.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:10; 
son of: Bilhan (H1092H); 
brother of: Jeush (H3266H), Benjamin (H1144H), Ehud (H0164H), Chenaanah (H3668H), Zethan (H2133) and Tarshish (H8659I) 
§ Ahishahar = "my brother is dawn" or "brother of the dawn"
a Benjamite

H0304G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:31; 
son of: Sheshan (H8348); married to Jarha (H3398); 
father of: Attai (H6262)
§ Ahlai = "O! would that!"
1) daughter of Sheshan
2) father of one of David's heroes (mighty men, warriors)

H0315.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Aharah at 1 Chroniques 8:1; 
Another name of e.chi (אֵחִי "Ehi" H0278) 
§ Aharah = "a following brother"
a son of Benjamin

H0326.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:6; 
son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Naarah (H5292B); 
brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488); 
half-brother of: Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976) 
§ Haahashtari = "I will diligently observe the searching"
a descendant of Ashur of Judah

H0345G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:24; 
son of: Zibeon (H6649H); 
brother of: Anah (H6034I)
§ Aiah or Ajah = "falcon"
1) a Horite, son of Zibeon
2) father of Rizpah, Saul's concubine

H0348.def:
A queen of the Kingdom of Israel, living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Rois 16:31; 
daughter of: Ethbaal (H0856); married to Ahab (H0256); 
mother of: Ahaziah (H0274) and Joram (H3141H)
Also named: Iezabēl (Ἰεζαβήλ "Jezebel" G2403) 
§ Jezebel = "Baal exalts" or "Baal is husband to" or "unchaste"
queen of Israel, wife of Ahab, daughter of Ethbaal

H0350.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 4:21; 
son of: Phinehas (H6372H); 
brother of: Ahitub (H0285) 
§ Ichabod = "no glory"
a son of Phinehas, so named because of the capture of the Ark by the Philistines

H0372.def:
A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 26:30; 
son of: Gilead (H1568H); 
brother of: Helek (H2507), Asriel (H0844), Shechem (H7928), Shemida (H8061) and Hepher (H2660A); also called Iezer (KJV: Jeezer) at Nombres 26:30; 
Another name of a.vi.e.zer (אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר "Abiezer" H0044I) 
§ Jeezer = "no help"
a descendant of Manasseh

H0373.def:
Someone descended from Iezer, a man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 26:30; 
son of: Gilead (H1568H); 
brother of: Helek (H2507), Asriel (H0844), Shechem (H7928), Shemida (H8061) and Hepher (H2660A); also called Iezer (KJV: Jeezer) at Nombres 26:30; 
Group of a.vi.e.zer (אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר "Abiezer" H0044I) 
§ Jeezerite = "no help"
one of the tribe of Jeezer

H0378.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 2:8; 
son of: Saul (H7586G); 
brother of: Jonathan (H3083H), Abinadab (H0041H), Malchi-shua (H4444), Merab (H4764), Michal (H4324), Armoni (H0764), Mephibosheth (H4648H)
Also named: esh.ba.al (אֶשְׁבַּעַל "Eshbaal" H0792) 
§ Ishbosheth = "man of shame"
surviving son of Saul, king of Israel for 7 years while David was king over Judah; succeeded by David who united the kingdom

H0384G.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Néhémie 11:7; 
son of: Jeshaiah (H3470K); 
father of: Maaseiah (H4641U)
§ Ithiel = "God is with me"
1) the disciple to whom Agur gave proverbs
2) a Benjamite in Nehemiah's time

H0385.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 6:23; 
son of: Aaron (H0175) and Elisheba (H0472); 
brother of: Nadab (H5070), Abihu (H0030) and Eleazar (H0499) 
§ Ithamar = "coast of palms"
fourth and youngest son of Aaron

H0387H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:6; 
son of: Zerah (H2226I); 
brother of: Zabdi (H2067), Heman (H1968H), Calcol (H3633H) and Dara (H1873); 
father of: Azariah (H5838I)
§ Ethan = "enduring"
1) an Ezrahite known for his wisdom
2) a grandson of Judah, father of Azariah
3) a Kohathite descendant of Levi
4) a Merarite son of Kushaiah, descendant of Levi

H0387I.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:21; 
son of: Zimmah (H2155); 
father of: Iddo (H5714H); also called Ethan at 1 Chroniques 6:42; 
Another name of yo.ach (יוֹאָח "Joah" H3098H)
§ Ethan = "enduring"
1) an Ezrahite known for his wisdom
2) a grandson of Judah, father of Azariah
3) a Kohathite descendant of Levi
4) a Merarite son of Kushaiah, descendant of Levi

H0387J.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:44; 
son of: Kishi (H7029); 
father of: Obed-edom (H5654), Mattithiah (H4993H), Gedaliah (H1436I), Zeri (H6874), Jeshaiah (H3470H), Hashabiah (H2811I), Shemaiah (H8098K) and Uzziel (H5816K); also called Ethan at 1 Chroniques 6:44; 15.17,19;
Another name of ye.du.tun (יְדוּתוּן "Jeduthun" H3038G)
§ Ethan = "enduring"
1) an Ezrahite known for his wisdom
2) a grandson of Judah, father of Azariah
3) a Kohathite descendant of Levi
4) a Merarite son of Kushaiah, descendant of Levi

H0397.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 21:10; 
son of: Maoch (H4582); also called Abimelech (NIV: Abimelek) at Psaumes 34:1; 
Also named: a.vi.me.lekh (אֲבִימֶ֫לֶךְ "Abimelech" H0040I) 
§ Achish = "I will blacken (or terrify)" or "only a man"
Philistine king of Gath
